{"study_accession":"PRJNA1262359","secondary_study_accession":"SRP584860","title":"Endogenous retroviruses promote aberrant T cell differentiation in systemic lupus erythematosus via the RIG-I pathway [SLE]","description":"The dysregulated differentiation of T lymphocytes play an important role in systemic lupus erythematosus (SLE). However, the underlying mechanism remains unclear. Here, we screened and identified many overexpressed HERVs in CD4+ T cells from SLE patients by RNA-seq and found that some HERVs formed dsRNAs to induce the activation of the RIG-I signaling pathway. And our findings reveal the roles and mechanism of HERVs and RIG-I in regulating the aberrant differentiation of T cells in SLE patients. Overall design: mRNA profiles of CD4+T cells of SLE and HCs","pubmed":"40992212","geo_series":"","n_samples":10,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN48452311","study_accession":"PRJNA1262359","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"CD4+T cells, SLE_T2","description":"CD4+T cells, SLE_T2","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM8981535","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2025-11-20","attributes":[["source_name","PBMC"],["tissue","PBMC"],["cell_type","CD4+T cells"],["treatment","SLE with Prednisone Treatment"],["geo_loc_name","missing"],["collection_date","missing"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR33541840","experiment_accession":"SRX28775765","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000","read_count":21845302,"base_count":1092265100,"first_public":"2025-11-20","experiment_title":"Illumina NovaSeq 6000 sequencing: GSM8981535: CD4+T cells, SLE_T2 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN48452312","study_accession":"PRJNA1262359","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"CD4+T cells, SLE_T1","description":"CD4+T cells, SLE_T1","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM8981534","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2025-11-20","attributes":[["sourc